{{% /choosable %}}
{{% choosable language hcl %}}

Declare the provider in your program, then run `pulumi install`:

```hcl
terraform {
  required_providers {
    ise = {
      source  = "pulumi/ise"
      version = "VERSION"
    }
  }
}
```

```bash
pulumi install
```

